  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You understand there is some element of your inclinations to the divine that is rooted in your past or from people who came before you. In addition to places of worship or study, you can use Hallowed Legacy to seek out or learn about places of legend or other noteworthy points of interest. As with Hallowed Legacy, the circumstance bonus increases to +2 if it has substantial relevance to your faith or philosophy.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.VjuIR8qlv1sXJ2lI]{Ancient Oaths} feat, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus if it has relation to your chosen creature type or their history, as well.</span></p>"
